i/Piece_of_Marble_Rock_988077.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Sword\"><img alt=\"Serpent Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Serpent_Sword_bbb6f6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\"><img alt=\"Dwarven Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarven_Ring_67bdd7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Farmine Mines Floor 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Farmine_Mines_Floor_1_5994a5.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Farmine Mines Floor 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"106\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Farmine_Mines_Floor_2_fac85e.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Farminecave\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Farminecave_6581ee.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.54<br/>December 9, 2009<br/>Christmas Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Farmine Mines</b> are only accessible after completing a certain mission of <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a>. It can be reached by entering a teleporter in <a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33030,31485,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33030, 31485, 10)</a>. It is one of the larger <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golem</a> spawns, and therefore a good place to do the <i>Stone Golem Mission</i> of the <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Killing in the Name of... Quest</a>.<br/>\n</p><p>The first level down has <a href=\"#/wiki/Gargoyle\">Gargoyles</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golems</a> close to the teleport and <a href=\"#/wiki/Gozzler\">Gozzlers</a> at the ends of each tunnel.<br/>\nThe second floor down has all three creatures near the entrance and throughout each tunnel.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gargoyle\"><img alt=\"Gargoyle\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gargoyle_02e1f9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Gargoyle\">Gargoyle</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">250</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">65 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-30× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Potato\">Potato</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stone</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Stone Wing (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-5× Strawberry (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Battle Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morning%20Star\">Morning Star</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Tooth%20Chain\">Wolf Tooth Chain</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Piece%20of%20Marble%20Rock\">Piece of Marble Rock</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Shiny Stone (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Club%20Ring\">Club Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Armor\">Dark Armor</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gozzler\"><img alt=\"Gozzler\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gozzler_e259e1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Gozzler\">G